  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "From the table, there are $4$ players (James, Daniel, Thomas, David) whose age is $10$ or more years.\n\nThere are $2$ students (Robert, Charles)  whose age is less than $10$ years.\n\nSo the ratio of students whose age is $10$ or more years to those whose age is less than $10$ years is $4:2.$",
